.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-system 1  "oct-system " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-system \- Initialization and similar functionality
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct system\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Initialization and similar functionality
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
oct\-system\-factory\-reset(1)
Completely reset a card (deletes all data including keys!)
.TP
oct\-system\-kdf\-setup(1)
Set up KDF mode
.TP
oct\-system\-set\-identity(1)
Change identity (Nitrokey Start only)
.TP
oct\-system\-activate\-file(1)
Activate File (recover from "card terminated" state)
.TP
oct\-system\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
